  m_text: '<size=24><color=#80D8FF><b>CADT Student Workstation Dispatch</b></color></size>


    You
    are working at your CADT cyber defense workstation. Your close classmate, <b>Sophea</b>,
    is about to message you on Telegram asking for urgent help with a research survey
    for their NextGen course project.


    <color=#FFCC80><b>ADVISORY:</b></color>
    Attackers frequently weaponize trust by compromising university peers'' accounts
    to distribute malicious reverse-proxy session hijackers.


    Inspect all details
    carefully before authorizing any requests.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
