  m_text: "\u2022 <b>Detect Phishing Lure:</b> Analyze incoming peer messages for
    urgency & suspicious links.\n\n\u2022 <b>Verify Out-of-Band:</b> Call friend
    to confirm account compromise.\n\n\u2022 <b>Audit URL & Protocol:</b> Detect
    unencrypted HTTP and reverse-proxy domain spoofing.\n\n\u2022 <b>Thwart Device
    Hijack:</b> Refuse deceptive Telegram desktop QR tokens.\n\n\u2022 <b>Enforce
    Cloud 2FA:</b> Enable Two-Step Verification to block unauthorized sessions."
